Description: Monitoring Topology widget for Zabbix dashboard (Vis Network)
 Zabbix dashboard widget that visualizes the monitoring path (Zabbix
 Server - Proxy - Network - Host) as an interactive topology graph
 using Vis Network (Canvas2D).
